      "review_summary": "The PR adds a Discord send-path preflight size check that omits attachments over Discord's upload cap, sends fallback text, and adds focused regression tests.\n\nPR surface: Source +60, Tests +67. Total +127 across 2 files.\n\nReproducibility: yes. Current main accepts an 11 MB Discord media file under the 100 MB OpenClaw cap and sends caption plus file in one Discord multipart request, so a Discord 413 can drop both together; the linked issue also provides production logs for that path.",
